  "description": "InfraNamedWindowOnDelete silent-delete semantics: @hint('silent_delete') strips the deleted rows from the named window's own-statement delivery while the on-delete output (deleted rows as new data) and tail-view consumers still observe the delta, over a length(2) window and a groupwin(theString)#length(2) window (Java source regression-lib/src/main/java/com/espertech/esper/regressionlib/suite/infra/namedwindow/InfraNamedWindowOnDelete.java)."
